-- Which listed row a section of Part 5 falls in (the ranges "sections 54 to 56" and "sections 66 to 74" are rows of the list).
@ref s 1047(4) Provisions of Part 5 that apply: the row for a section number (src:14710-14726)
GIVEN `the number of the section of Part 5` IS A NUMBER
      `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` IS A STRING
GIVETH A `s 1047(4) provision of Part 5`
`s 1047(4) the row of the list for the section of Part 5` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 53 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "" THEN `s 1047(4)(a) section 53 (prohibited names)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 53 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "A" THEN `s 1047(4)(aa) section 53A (names for criminal purposes)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` AT LEAST 54 AND `the number of the section of Part 5` AT MOST 56 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "" THEN `s 1047(4)(b) sections 54 to 56 (sensitive words and expressions)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 56 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "A" THEN `s 1047(4)(bza) section 56A (names suggesting connection with foreign governments etc)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 57 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "" THEN `s 1047(4)(ba) section 57 (permitted characters etc)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 57 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "A" THEN `s 1047(4)(bb) section 57A (names containing computer code)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 57 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "B" THEN `s 1047(4)(bc) section 57B (restriction on re-registering name following direction)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 57 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "C" THEN `s 1047(4)(bd) section 57C (names that another company has been directed to change)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 65 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "" THEN `s 1047(4)(c) section 65 (inappropriate use of indications of company type or legal form)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` AT LEAST 66 AND `the number of the section of Part 5` AT MOST 74 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "" THEN `s 1047(4)(d) sections 66 to 74 (similarity to other names)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 75 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "" THEN `s 1047(4)(e) section 75 (provision of misleading information etc)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 76 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "" THEN `s 1047(4)(f) section 76 (misleading indication of activities)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 76 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "A" THEN `s 1047(4)(g) section 76A (power to direct change of name used for criminal purposes)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 76 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "B" THEN `s 1047(4)(h) section 76B (direction to change name wrongly registered)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 76 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "C" THEN `s 1047(4)(i) section 76C (registrar's power to change name containing computer code)`
        IF `the number of the section of Part 5` EQUALS 76 AND `the letter that follows the number, or the empty string` EQUALS "D" THEN `s 1047(4)(j) section 76D (registrar's power to change name for failure to comply with direction)`
        OTHERWISE `s 1047(4) another provision of Part 5`

